# gtd-frontend — agent instructions

## What this is

React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 6 + Tailwind CSS v4 frontend for
[java-gtd](https://github.com/mmilei/java-gtd). See [README.md](README.md) for the
feature overview, stack, and project structure.

## Read first

- `README.md` — features, getting started, `src/` structure
- `src/lib/types.ts` — the API contract shared with the backend

## Working rules

- **Never push to master directly.** Branch → push → pull request.
- Run `npm run build` (type-check + bundle) before committing.
- **Never put backend code in this repo.** The API lives in
  [java-gtd](https://github.com/mmilei/java-gtd); this repo only talks to it over HTTP.
- Keep `src/lib/api.ts` and `src/lib/api.mock.ts` in sync — the mock must expose the
  same functions and data shapes as the real client (`VITE_MOCK=true` swaps them at build time).

## Development

```bash
npm run dev              # against a local backend on :8080 (Vite proxies /api/*)
VITE_MOCK=true npm run dev   # no backend needed — in-memory mock
```

Pushes to `master` deploy the mock build to GitHub Pages automatically.

